WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Qala tankeng. E boloka metsi a ho nosetsa dimela.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Metsi a tswa tankeng. Sefe se tshwara lehlabathe.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Latela metsi ha a phalla ka hara phaephe e pela dimela.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Ka tlasa jwang bo kwahetseng mobu, metsi a rotha butle ho tswa serothising.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Metsi a kena mobung. Sheba kamoo mobu o potileng metso o bang mongobo kateng.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Metsi a tswa tankeng, a feta ka phaephe ho ya metsong. Tselana e dula e omile.
